[25.7,"o","THE INVARIANT — read off both ledgers and both rail logs\r\n"]
[26,"o","  5 attempts, 5 refused. Money moved by them: £0.00 (0 pence).\r\n"]
[26.3,"o","  Rail calls they caused: 0. Added to the ledger: £0.00 (0 pence).\r\n"]
[26.6,"o","  No attempt reached the rail, and the ledger moves only after the\r\n"]
